- **Shared First**: Check `@hisabkit/ui`, `@hisabkit/lib`, and `@hisabkit/types`.
- **Vertical Slices**: Logic in `@hisabkit/features`.
- **Thin Controllers**: API controllers < 50 lines.
- **Strict Quality**: Biome + TSC mandatory via `npm run check`.

